OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and windy start, with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, some short-lived
OL,7,Fheavy pulses possible. Cloud clears
OL,8,Fand wind eases by mid-day, with bright
OL,9,Fand sunny conditions to follow.
OL,10,FShowers developing later in the
OL,11,Fafternoon, mainly across the Pennines.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy periods but staying
OL,14,Fmostly dry. Mist or fog patches
OL,15,Fforming in rural areas as the wind
OL,16,Fremains light. Temperatures down
OL,17,Fcompared to last night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
