OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FDry with sunny spells for
OL,6,Fmost, although isolated showers may
OL,7,Fdevelop across the Pennines. The wind
OL,8,Fpicking up in the afternoon, before
OL,9,Feasing by the evening. Slightly warm
OL,10,Fthan average.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBreezy
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of rain on Friday.
OL,14,FCloudy and possibly wet in places on
OL,15,FSaturday. Fog patches clear,
OL,16,Fpredominantly dry with variable cloud
OL,17,Fon Sunday. Temperatures remain above
OL,18,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
